{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1432.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"fd43a9b120a274d7f291cd2599ff0346e63ee05a7953a087c17fee323740a3a2","ja":"あっ……うぎゃー！\nやっちゃったぞ～！","zh":"啊……哇啊——！\n搞砸了啦～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1432.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"b7c3d02e686d7624796c32a4eb4c53c4fbd5b7eac5b57c3a8991976f037f89be","ja":"あっ、いつもの響に戻ったみたいだね！","zh":"啊，看来变回平时的响了呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1432.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"7603bca9bd0fd2354ded52d4c506113575eeac154442a01fa64d7c0dcd459fdf","ja":"うう……その通りだぞ……。","zh":"呜呜……确实是这样啊……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1432.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"be8df636e2db31c235d0d5387c052d8990cff04c77a0191e2377fa5a1306b642","ja":"それで、結局何があったの？","zh":"所以，最后到底发生了什么事？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1432.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"dcd617c7d57e6a4afd86b0c10dd2c7e471d702d1b73c508f051fe0b51e86f7fc","ja":"自分、これからは劇場のみんなを温かく見守る\n月みたいに……『ルナ』みたいになろうと思ったんだ。","zh":"我决定了，今后要像温柔守护剧场大家的\n月亮一样……成为像“露娜”那样的存在。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1432.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"2d0ad6daa031ba64f43c01f0e8bb39f1d58a030f48c6a3e5b50e76f0fba5abf6","ja":"みんなのことを優しく見てたら、\n『ルナ』っぽいでしょ？","zh":"温柔地注视着大家的话，\n就很有“露娜”的感觉对吧？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1432.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"591d5b358ba94f037da2e737ce018e74becab643d357abfae29c5abdbbe41b19","ja":"なるほど、だから静かだったんだね。\n何か問題を起こしたわけじゃなくて良かったよ。","zh":"原来如此，所以才这么安静啊。\n没惹出什么麻烦真是太好了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1432.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"b6d3eb9852ea1f53debbbc14ad7b30a6b53e2d65754d7e638bf3c6550df4cd98","ja":"自分、そんなことしないぞ！　……多分。","zh":"我才不会做那种事呢！……大概吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1432.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"a74e5d2453cc22f4769d439b68627ed3933b8807c5cdf7a32fcf8ecfaf7dd81f","ja":"でも自分には、『ルナ』みたいになるのは\n無理なのかな……？","zh":"可是对自己来说，想要变成像“露娜”那样，\n果然还是不行吗……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1432.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"5ac18a8cd4c4e6ae2eddb8d45979bfc6ff29820441b7363179f75784f121b04d","ja":"そんなことないんじゃないかしら。\n月にだっていろんな表情があるもの。","zh":"没这回事吧。\n毕竟月亮也有各种各样的表情呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1432.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"22be48327f8c012124a517de2cd2a1b9ce1483df3e5e3600eca0dbc57486a777","ja":"そうですね。新月や三日月……\n満月やスーパームーンも。","zh":"是啊。新月、蛾眉月……\n满月和超级月亮也是。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1432.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"ae80280ffe5162334582565d6ce10e73f6c0e46a1d6e50b69b469b72802607a4","ja":"ええ。それなら、元気な響ちゃんも、\n『ルナ』みたいって、言えるんじゃないかしら♪","zh":"嗯。这样的话，充满活力的响\n不也能说是像“露娜”一样吗♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1432.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"fa300178033d445eb916ca60a9b20d1ff904aa583c6fc318fa8b4f620b784f86","ja":"そっかー、スーパームーンなら……ま、まぁ！\n自分も最初からそう思ってたけどね！","zh":"原来是超级月亮啊……嘛、嘛！\n其实我也从一开始就是这么想的啦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1432.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"430428823a29eb9ad32e69b814389eaaa577d233ef331b4d1f0f5bcb1ea70528","ja":"これからは劇場のみんなを明るく照らす\n『ルナ』になるさー！","zh":"今后我要成为照亮剧场大家的\n“露娜”啦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1432.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"654425acc8614bf3636cf1c9c9f74bb81cb752a4e95a143718c609c62e35a80a","ja":"あははっ、\nやっぱり響はこうじゃなくちゃね♪","zh":"啊哈哈，\n响果然就得是这样才对呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:17:54+00:00"}
